{"id":"iw.8","n":"iw","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"iw","ver":"6.9-1.el9","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/i/iw-6.9-1.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/iw.8.gz","sha256":"d89dbd04da260039c41b05aaf02300964d2a8e4c8a6a451f888d6d221d92abae","date":"22 November 2020","origin":"iw"},"u":{"pkg":"iw","ver":"5.16-1build1","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/i/iw/iw_5.16-1build1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/iw.8.gz","sha256":"a34817f9ec9e05ba375cd60588d6c44a4a1b780b0e1a3a615b00dbb71a667fba","date":"22 November 2020","origin":"iw"}},"nopt":{"r":2,"u":2},"desc":"show / manipulate wireless devices and their configuration","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>iw - show / manipulate wireless devices and their configuration</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<br> <p><b>iw</b> [<i> OPTIONS </i>]{ <b>help</b> [ <i>command</i> ] <b>|</b> <i>OBJECT</i> <i>COMMAND</i> }</p>  <p><i>OBJECT</i> := { <b>dev</b> | <b>phy</b> | <b>reg</b> }</p>  <p><i>OPTIONS</i> := { --version | --debug }</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b> --version</b></dt><dd>print version information and exit.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b> --debug</b></dt><dd>enable netlink message debugging.</dd></dl>"],["IW - COMMAND SYNTAX","<h3>OBJECT</h3> <dl><dt data-c=\"\" data-g=\"OBJECT\"><b>dev &lt;interface name&gt;</b></dt><dd>- network interface.</dd><dt data-c=\"\" data-g=\"OBJECT\"><b>phy &lt;phy name&gt;</b></dt><dd>- wireless hardware device (by name).</dd><dt data-c=\"\" data-g=\"OBJECT\"><b>phy#&lt;phy index&gt;</b></dt><dd>- wireless hardware device (by index).</dd><dt data-c=\"\" data-g=\"OBJECT\"><b>reg</b></dt><dd>- regulatory agent.</dd></dl>   <h3>COMMAND</h3> <p>Specifies the action to perform on the object. The set of possible actions depends on the object type. <b>iw help</b> will print all supported commands, while <b>iw help command</b> will print the help for all matching commands.</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>ip</b>(8), <b>crda</b>(8), <b>regdbdump</b>(8), <b>regulatory.bin</b>(5).</p> <p><a href=\"https://wireless.wiki.kernel.org/en/users/Documentation/iw\">Documentation at kernel wiki</a>.</p>"]]}